{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A card battle adventure where you trade a girl's \u201cprecious things\u201d for points.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use four cards drawn from various decks to defeat enemies and reach the goal.<br>The deck is also the girl you control,<br>and each card you use\u2014representing things like \u201csight,\u201d \u201cspeech,\u201d \u201clove,\u201d or \u201cmemory\u201d\u2014comes at a cost to her.<br>The cost affects not just her reactions, but also the user interface, background music, story, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839720/extras/22ffe7b9816fb55a940a05db08072834.poster.avif?t=1754134346\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839720/extras/22ffe7b9816fb55a940a05db08072834.webm?t=1754134346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839720/extras/5b90ac5a963d117a9744840e7d99b5c3.avif?t=1754134346\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Girl (Akatsuki Ai)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI have to get home\u2026 to my beloved family.\u201d<br>The protagonist of the game.<br>A cheerful girl with a bright smile, known for her red hood.<br>She wakes up in a mysterious forest and searches for a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839720/extras/a39e751d03ff29332da5893e86b1ca42.avif?t=1754134346\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Boy (Ibarahara Suon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAi-chan, I believe in you.\u201d<br>A boy shrouded in mystery.<br>He appears before the girl, gives her advice and cards, then vanishes.<br>There\u2019s something lonely about him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839720/extras/f08c300b2be759db661eb6ec6c41dcbe.avif?t=1754134346\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow White (Shirayuki Rikka)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHere comes the cutest of all\u2014Rikka-chan!\u201d<br>A queen who rules a kingdom and livestreams through a magic mirror.<br>She believes she\u2019s the cutest in the world and has many fans.<br>She seems to have an unusual obsession with the protagonist\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGood morning, Akatsuki Ai-chan\u2014\u201d<br>A young girl finds herself in a strange forest, where she meets a mysterio us boy.<br>Terrifying creatures roam the forest\u2014it\u2019s dangerous to stay.<br>In her hands: an unfamiliar grimoire and mysterious cards.<br>\u201cThese cards are your power\u2014and your \u2018cost.\u2019\u201d<br>Through her journey, what will the girl keep, lose, and gain?<br>And just one final wish\u2014<br>\u201cPlease\u2026 just don\u2019t sacrifice your love.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839720?t=1754134346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839720?t=1754134346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_